{
"file": 307,
"paths": [
"d008/d000/f020"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "e449aba6",
"en_raw": "See, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "e179518f",
"en_raw": "hated it, didn't she"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "cdf622ee",
"en_raw": "Hey, what are you doing?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "9c305e6e",
"en_raw": "Which school are you from?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "cb664006",
"en_raw": "...Huh?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "4e418162",
"en_raw": "Look closely, you're a girl"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "7eb12557",
"en_raw": "What are you thinking?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "0727b153",
"en_raw": "A girl shouldn't come"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "fc28f162",
"en_raw": "to a place like this"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "7e19a56a",
"en_raw": "Your parents will cry"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "1dce838d",
"en_raw": "What on earth"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "1402c85a",
"en_raw": "did you come here for"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "8727c84b",
"en_raw": "It's not for"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "a9758724",
"en_raw": "unhealthy reasons like that"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "2f87eedc",
"en_raw": "It's just a test of courage"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "834fcb8c",
"en_raw": "...A test of courage?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "620a575e",
"en_raw": "...A test of courage, you say?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "7eba5d92",
"en_raw": "Why in a place like this..."
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "37d2aaf2",
"en_raw": "Is there some story about it?"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "e71c7a94",
"en_raw": "You don't know, mister?"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "a5db4ba2",
"en_raw": "Yokai appear here"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "ae01565e",
"en_raw": "Yokai? ...What's that?"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "4513f801",
"en_raw": "Don't say weird things"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "94db3b22",
"en_raw": "If you don't know, never mind"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "a20f5f36",
"en_raw": "We're going home"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "a58108ce",
"en_raw": "Hey, hey"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "2b5bd838",
"en_raw": "Wait a moment"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "264b8233",
"en_raw": "Um... what are yokai?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "ce94e74c",
"en_raw": "I can't have strange rumors going around"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "50b0a1d3",
"en_raw": "Could it be, mister"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "21828ba4",
"en_raw": "that you own this place?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "79af60ab",
"en_raw": "...It's awful, really"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "e94e618a",
"en_raw": "High schoolers break the machines"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "2a723bea",
"en_raw": "kids like you come"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "6a139c74",
"en_raw": "almost every day"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "5de2441f",
"en_raw": "and on top of that, weird rumors"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "59c04413",
"en_raw": "going around..."
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "6a63b60c",
"en_raw": "Did someone come recently?"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "3e83d991",
"en_raw": "Someone like a middle schooler?"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "c5ef5400",
"en_raw": "They come in astonishing numbers..."
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "5617185e",
"en_raw": "So the other day"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "4a0ee314",
"en_raw": "I hid in the gap by the vending machine"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "aa78057d",
"en_raw": "and gave one a little scare"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "7b246209",
"en_raw": "and he ran away"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "07d47f63",
"en_raw": "Um, was he a small one?"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "080ee6c8",
"en_raw": "Just the other day, too"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "60635aa7",
"en_raw": "a kid like an elementary schooler came"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "4a0ee314",
"en_raw": "I hid in the gap by the vending machine"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "aa78057d",
"en_raw": "and gave one a little scare"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "7b246209",
"en_raw": "and he ran away"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "77f54fd6",
"en_raw": "Yuasa..."
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "a4071951",
"en_raw": "Yeah, the one who ran off"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "f9a95368",
"en_raw": "was a small one"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "40830727",
"en_raw": "Honestly, elementary schoolers"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "e5df9d58",
"en_raw": "these days..."
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "dba1184a",
"en_raw": "Yuasa talked about"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "5dfea575",
"en_raw": "the Peeping Old Man..."
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "41840634",
"en_raw": "Huh...?"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "10f3d731",
"en_raw": "Could it be that the yokai"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "3d03e7f1",
"en_raw": "was me?"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "24a37fea",
"en_raw": "No doubt"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "dc182766",
"en_raw": "It's a ridiculous story..."
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "7b430167",
"en_raw": "Lately even the security cameras"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "598f40cf",
"en_raw": "get vandalized"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "87468bfc",
"en_raw": "so watching myself"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "dc802548",
"en_raw": "is far more reassuring"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "f3ad7027",
"en_raw": "Then isn't it your own fault"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "0950c6ad",
"en_raw": "that weird rumors spread?"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "8258c344",
"en_raw": "My own fault, you say"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "5cd9bfbb",
"en_raw": "Nobody does it because they like it"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "51a9ad53",
"en_raw": "If you kids didn't come"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "73052d26",
"en_raw": "I could be sleeping at home"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "9afe76bd",
"en_raw": "Honestly, if you kids didn't come"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "30cbcb9f",
"en_raw": "I could be sleeping at home..."
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "890e9aba",
"en_raw": "Hmm, a perfect stalemate of arguments..."
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "39a5661c",
"en_raw": "I could report it to the police box"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "5bfa96da",
"en_raw": "but that would be going too far"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "9825df2d",
"en_raw": "Honestly, I'm doing this out of kindness"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "0b679132",
"en_raw": "It's really insulting"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "aab105fb",
"en_raw": "Tough for you too, mister"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "759716fb",
"en_raw": "Whose fault do you think it is?"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "74f58b4d",
"en_raw": "Next time I'll call your school"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "988f40d1",
"en_raw": "Sorry~"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "6ae0d11a",
"en_raw": "Next time I catch you"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "c39f2237",
"en_raw": "I'll call your school"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "988f40d1",
"en_raw": "Sorry~"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "217a1cbf",
"en_raw": "What are you doing?"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "99da849e",
"en_raw": "Come on, off you go"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "988f40d1",
"en_raw": "Sorry~"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "6b44ea3b",
"en_raw": "We won't do it again~"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "768384a0",
"en_raw": "Wait a moment"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "04488f67",
"en_raw": "We're not done talking"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "95c57180",
"en_raw": "Oh, that's right"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "c476431b",
"en_raw": "You two wait here"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "38809efa",
"en_raw": "It'd be bad if that man comes"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "3db2f2a1",
"en_raw": "Hold on"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "d93671aa",
"en_raw": "We're not done talking"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "ef8d2cd7",
"en_raw": "Take your eyes off him for a second"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "0b3e4f0f",
"en_raw": "and it's like this"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "53a7edd2",
"en_raw": "She's too young, I'm telling you!"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "44c0748b",
"en_raw": "I told you no so many times"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "002b0bc5",
"en_raw": "Why do you keep coming back..."
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "023cda4c",
"en_raw": "No, you don't understand"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "6d7cd684",
"en_raw": "We found something"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "abe46cc9",
"en_raw": "Something amazing"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "9a705584",
"en_raw": "Trying to dodge the subject again"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "25fe2ef9",
"en_raw": "Mister"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "b12e9409",
"en_raw": "you're the owner here, right?"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "4ac50fef",
"en_raw": "It'd be bad if a yokai rumor spread"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "ab3345b1",
"en_raw": "wouldn't it?"
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "4651c52f",
"en_raw": "Before making excuses, say"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "6bba99da",
"en_raw": "what you saw"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "81d62d9a",
"en_raw": "Tell me what you saw"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "9203cfd8",
"en_raw": "What about a hole?"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "d4686e08",
"en_raw": "So?"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "1c1d7955",
"en_raw": "A hole, a hole!"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "568149d3",
"en_raw": "The vending machine spot"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "5ba358fe",
"en_raw": "connects to the house"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "96494704",
"en_raw": "next door, right?"
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "3ad94abf",
"en_raw": "That's the Kikutani place"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "c66c269e",
"en_raw": "From there, some"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "cc8c951c",
"en_raw": "unidentifiable thing"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "ed84457e",
"en_raw": "comes in"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "e9004a1f",
"en_raw": "My friend saw it, so"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "8388b3b8",
"en_raw": "Oh, that..."
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "1d499c73",
"en_raw": "Well, I don't like saying it, but"
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "10f3856e",
"en_raw": "it's probably old man Kikutani"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "6216b6b9",
"en_raw": "No, I mean, kid or"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "f44c723d",
"en_raw": "old man"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "0f54b251",
"en_raw": "it's not a hole of a size"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "04f1b4e8",
"en_raw": "a person could pass through"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "90ba3778",
"en_raw": "Even so, Kikutani's"
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "f942eadd",
"en_raw": "old man, probably"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "ad5d894e",
"en_raw": "Do you think I'd believe"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "08463cea",
"en_raw": "such an unscientific story?"
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "af58fd40",
"en_raw": "I don't expect you"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "4b1b3d2c",
"en_raw": "to understand"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "e75bfe76",
"en_raw": "Well, you"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "6352ad08",
"en_raw": "wouldn't get this story, I think"
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "0276f611",
"en_raw": "Why, why"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "9a745b26",
"en_raw": "You're making fun of me as a kid, right?"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "74a681fd",
"en_raw": "No, I'm not"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "70b82940",
"en_raw": "It's because you're a girl"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "d3d19e9b",
"en_raw": "Well, don't sulk"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "60dd71a8",
"en_raw": "I'm not making fun of you"
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "25a19f93",
"en_raw": "at all"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "60dd71a8",
"en_raw": "I'm not making fun of you"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "c7614634",
"en_raw": "It's just because you're a girl"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "2498783a",
"en_raw": "that you don't understand"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "5f442e33",
"en_raw": "You shouldn't stay"
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "44540aa5",
"en_raw": "in a place like this forever"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "779a0b85",
"en_raw": "Go home, go home, quickly"
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "ed047bf9",
"en_raw": "...Fine, never mind"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "b7f020a6",
"en_raw": "Goodbye"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "a750e839",
"en_raw": "No good, he's completely watching us"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "ed99d5d3",
"en_raw": "I don't know the road ahead..."
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "b5bb2ada",
"en_raw": "For a walk, this is"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "e7d20466",
"en_raw": "a bit too far"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "c0e859da",
"en_raw": "If we go somewhere unfamiliar"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "c1f8d9b5",
"en_raw": "we won't be able to get home"
}
]
}